# 📈 TradeLab

## Trading Strategy Simulator

TradeLab is a full-stack trading strategy simulation platform that allows users to create, test, and analyze trading strategies using simulated market data.

Users can configure technical indicator-based BUY and SELL rules, run backtests, visualize trades on charts, analyze performance, and save their backtest history securely using Firebase.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 User Authentication using Firebase
- 📊 Simulated Market Data Generation
- 📈 Interactive Trading Charts
- 📉 Technical Indicators
  - SMA 20
  - SMA 50
  - EMA 20
  - RSI 14
- 🟢 Custom BUY Rules
- 🔴 Custom SELL Rules
- ⚙️ Backend Backtesting Engine
- 💰 Initial Capital Configuration
- 📊 Performance Analysis
- 📈 Profit and Loss Calculation
- 📉 Return Percentage Calculation
- 🟢 Winning and Losing Trade Analysis
- 🛒 Trade History
- 📍 BUY and SELL Markers on Chart
- 💾 Save Backtest Results to Firebase Firestore
- 📚 View Previously Saved Backtests
- 🔄 Generate New Simulated Market Datasets
- 🚪 User Logout Functionality

---

